017|- **CORS Support**: Cross-origin resource sharing configuration
018|
019|## 2. Key Implementation Patterns
020|
021|### Client-Side Patterns (React)
022|
023|#### Checkout Component Implementation
024|```javascript
025|// Key patterns observed:
026|- Uses React hooks (useState, useEffect) for state management
027|- Implements loading states during payment processing
