047|- Offers navigation options back to checkout
048|```
049|
050|### Server-Side Patterns (Node.js)
051|
052|#### API Endpoint Structure
053|```javascript
054|// Key server endpoints:
055|- POST /create-checkout-session: Creates new payment sessions with line items
056|- GET /checkout-session: Retrieves and validates session details
057|- Environment Variables: Secure management of API keys and domain settings
058|```
