075|};
076|```
077|
078|## 3. Configuration Requirements
079|
080|### Environment Variables
081|- `MAGPIE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`: Client-side publishable key for frontend
082|- `MAGPIE_SECRET_KEY`: Server-side secret key (never expose to client)
083|- `MAGPIE_CHECKOUT_API_HOST`: API endpoint for Magpie services
084|- `DOMAIN`: Application domain for success/cancel redirect URLs
085|- `STATIC_DIR`: Directory for serving static files
086|
087|### Dependencies
088|- **Client**: React, React Router, fetch API
089|- **Server**: Express.js, CORS, dotenv, node-fetch, path
090|
