097|];
098|```
099|
100|## 4. Security Considerations
101|
102|### Best Practices Identified
103|- **Server-side session creation**: All payment sessions created on backend
104|- **API key protection**: Secret keys never exposed to client-side code
105|- **Basic Authentication**: Uses Base64 encoded secret key for API authentication
106|- **Session validation**: Always validate payment sessions on success page
107|- **HTTPS enforcement**: Secure communication for all payment operations
108|- **Environment separation**: Proper development/production configuration
109|
110|### Authentication Pattern
111|```javascript
112|// Secure header generation:
113|const generateHeaders = () => {
114|  return {
115|    'Content-Type': 'application/json',
116|    'Authorization': 'Basic ' + Buffer.from(process.env.MAGPIE_SECRET_KEY + ":").toString('base64'),
117|  }
118|};
119|```
