121|## 5. Payment Flow Implementation
122|
123|### Complete Payment Process
124|1. User initiates checkout from frontend
125|2. Client sends request to `/create-checkout-session` endpoint
126|3. Server creates Magpie checkout session with line items
127|4. Server returns `checkoutUrl` to client
128|5. Client redirects user to Magpie payment page
129|6. User completes payment on Magpie platform
130|7. Magpie redirects to success/cancel URL with session ID
131|8. Application validates session via `/checkout-session` endpoint
132|9. Order confirmation or error handling based on validation
