134|### Session Validation Flow
135|```javascript
136|// Success page validation pattern:
137|1. Extract sessionId from URL query parameters
138|2. Call backend /checkout-session endpoint with sessionId
139|3. Backend fetches session details from Magpie API
140|4. Display session information or handle errors
